    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an independent project developed by two people. It was created with limited resources and a light-hearted spirit. Please approach it for what it is, without expecting too much.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Development is ongoing: updates and patches will be released regularly. The developers are also available on the Discord of the game to chat, gather feedback, and play with the community.</p>",
